request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true. --behaviour

governor turn 1: plan -> types, commands  (The Todo type has no `completed` field. Its completion flag is `done`, which the `complete` command sets, so I'm treating `done` as the field the request means. Plan: add a `clear` variant to Command in types, then add `clear` to commands (the function, parseArgs and run). Remaining todos keep their ids, and the command reports how many it removed.)
round 1: owners types=ok commands=ok; oracle GREEN
