governor turn 2: accept  (Oracle is green: tsc is clean and all 17 vitest tests pass, including the acceptance tests. Those tests check that clear removes done todos, keeps the ids and order, doesn't change its input, and that run saves the result and reports "Cleared N". The Command type now includes { kind: "clear" } and parseArgs handles it. Existing CLI behaviour is unchanged.)

